    "hint": "Call request({id: \"0195f3a1-6c4d-7a2b-9e10-5f6a7b8c9d24\", input: {\"prompt\":\"<prompt>\"}}) alone and wait for its result. For several takes, add count: 2–5 to the same call; each take is its own payment."
